[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524034830","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100114#issuecomment-2524034830","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100114","id":2524034830,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WcbcO","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T19:45:31Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T19:46:09Z","body":"Are you able to turn on BPCT or ASTC quality mode? The dxt5 and etc2 modes are tuned for speed and not quality.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524034830/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524052070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100114#issuecomment-2524052070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100114","id":2524052070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wcfpm","user":{"login":"Interference","id":10870288,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODcwMjg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10870288?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference","html_url":"https://github.com/Interference","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T19:56:57Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T20:04:03Z","body":"> Are you able to turn on BPCT or ASTC quality mode? The dxt5 and etc2 modes are tuned for speed and not quality.\n\nYes, although that presents another problem: the current implementation of BPCT in Godot, at least for files without an alpha channel, are nearly twice the size of their DXT1 counterparts. This might also be a bug but I'm unsure. Converted textures list the type as RGBA even though the source files don't have an alpha channel, meaning the conversion process is treating them as if they have one. Either BC7 doesn't have a format variation for texture without transparency (although I believe it does, specifically mode 2) or the converter isn't using it.\n\nThat said, I'm fully aware DXT compression is of a lower quality but it shouldn't be THIS low. That much is evident when doing the compression yourself rather than leaving it to Godot, something I'd rather not have to do since the whole point of having Godot handle it is to speed the process of getting art into the engine.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524052070/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524067350","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100114#issuecomment-2524067350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100114","id":2524067350,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WcjYW","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T20:06:37Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T20:09:00Z","body":"I revisited the texture compression code for etc2 and dxt5; there needs to be a tunable for etcpak, but doesn't exist right now.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/modules/etcpak/image_compress_etcpak.cpp#L256\n\nHowever, Godot Engine has Betsy, which does fast BPTC encoding without importing the industry standard ISPC library dependency. https://github.com/GameTechDev/ISPCTextureCompressor\n\nIn what direction do you want Godot Engine to optimize so I can estimate the options?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524067350/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524074387","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100114#issuecomment-2524074387","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100114","id":2524074387,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WclGT","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T20:11:16Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T20:11:16Z","body":"1. I don't know if we can rewrite or upgrade etcpak to have higher quality\n2. Importing [ISPCTextureCompressor](https://github.com/GameTechDev/ISPCTextureCompressor) is not wanted because of the ispc dependency. When I investigate 5 years ago, it was an external process.\n3. We could set Betsy as the default for better texture compression quality.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524074387/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524084651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100114#issuecomment-2524084651","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100114","id":2524084651,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wcnmr","user":{"login":"Interference","id":10870288,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODcwMjg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10870288?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference","html_url":"https://github.com/Interference","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T20:18:38Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T20:21:05Z","body":"> I revisited the texture compression code for etc2 and dxt5; there's no tunable for etcpak.\n> \n> https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/modules/etcpak/image_compress_etcpak.cpp#L256\n> \n> However, Godot Engine has Betsy, which does fast BPTC encoding without importing the standard ISPC library dependency.\n> \n> In what direction do you want Godot Engine to optimize so I can estimate the options?\n\nThe ideal solution would be if you were able to tweak the DXT compression functionality to increase its quality to something broadly comparable to the image uploader example I linked. Even just reducing the blocky discolouration would help. From your response, it sounds like that would be a challenge, though.\n\nWhile it's not strictly a fix in of itself, I wouldn't have an issue with switching to BPTC compression to side step the issue if the files weren't so large.\n\nDoes conversion to BC7 only output files with an alpha channel? If I am correct and there is a variant that does NOT include an alpha channel, are textures encoded in it notably smaller? If they are, would you be able to make Godot's texture importer detect image files without an alpha channel and use that variation instead?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524084651/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524164442","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100114#issuecomment-2524164442","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100114","id":2524164442,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wc7Fa","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T20:58:24Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T20:58:24Z","body":"@BlueCube3310 thought?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524164442/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524179888","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100114#issuecomment-2524179888","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100114","id":2524179888,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wc-2w","user":{"login":"Interference","id":10870288,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODcwMjg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10870288?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference","html_url":"https://github.com/Interference","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T21:09:45Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T21:09:45Z","body":"I put my research hat on and had a look into BC7 and, from what I can tell at least, it seems like you get an alpha channel with it whether you like it or not, meaning I don't think there's an avenue for reducing BC7 texture file sizes.\n\nMy current workaround is as follows:\n\n1. For textures with transparency and normal maps I set \"High Quality\" and import them as BC7\n2. For textures with no transparency I manually convert them to DXT1 using Nvidia's Texture Tools Exporter and drop the results into my project\n\nThis isn't exactly ideal as there's an extra step each time a texture is altered (plus you lose a few other useful features) but the quality difference is night and day and and the files are half the size of BC7.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524179888/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524215064","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100114#issuecomment-2524215064","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100114","id":2524215064,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WdHcY","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T21:32:42Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T21:32:42Z","body":"bc6 might be the one without alpha","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524215064/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524222288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100114#issuecomment-2524222288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100114","id":2524222288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WdJNQ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T21:37:18Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T21:37:18Z","body":"> bc6 might be the one without alpha\n\nBC6H is RGB HDR. BC7 is RGBA LDR. And yes, BC7 will always be twice the size of DXT1. \n\nWe don't have a GPU compressor for BC7 right now, so it is also very slow to import. \n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524222288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524225271","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100114#issuecomment-2524225271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100114","id":2524225271,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WdJ73","user":{"login":"Interference","id":10870288,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODcwMjg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10870288?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference","html_url":"https://github.com/Interference","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Interference/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T21:39:50Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T21:39:50Z","body":"> bc6 might be the one without alpha\n\nI experimented with that in Texture Tools. It lists two variations, signed and unsigned, both without alpha but it seems to produce only slightly smaller files than BC7 (341kb rather than around 350kb for a 512x512 image).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524225271/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524228950","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100114#issuecomment-2524228950","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100114","id":2524228950,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WdK1W","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T21:42:51Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T21:42:51Z","body":"The difference is just header data.  They are fixed format compression schemes, so each 4x4 block always has the same size\n\nI just tested that PNG locally and I am not getting the green color. I am using master, so I will try again in 4.3 to check if this 